GAL16V8
BUFFER

/OE DAB NC NC NC NC NC NC NC GND 
NC  NC  A0 A1 A2 B0 B1 B2 NC VCC

; A -> B when enabled and DAB is asserted

B0.T = A0
B1.T = A1
B2.T = A2

B0.EN = OE & DAB
B1.EN = OE & DAB
B2.EN = OE & DAB

; B -> A when enabled and DAB is disasserted

A0.T = B0
A1.T = B1
A2.T = B2

A0.EN = OE & /DAB
A1.EN = OE & /DAB
A2.EN = OE & /DAB

DESCRIPTION
A 3-bit bidirectional buffer.
